REVIEW COMMENT:
The `testNoopCommit` test appears to be incorrectly asserting that the metadata version increases (`currentVersion += 1`) during a no-op commit. If the no-op correctly prevents a version increment, `updatedVersion` will be equal to `currentVersion`, causing this assertion to fail. The increment should be removed so that it asserts `updatedVersion` is equal to the original `currentVersion`.

